#: ../../source/docs/modules/sensors.rst:3 274f9e4e708648e2ae37d91e12df73b5
msgid "Sensor Reporting"
msgstr "传感器报告"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/sensors.rst:9 381c929d59414e79bcaac052c413615b
msgid ""
"Provides regular reporting to the console of the UAV's current speed, "
"altitude and heading. It also reports any variances or disagreement between "
"the sensors."
msgstr "定期向控制台报告无人机当前速度、高度和航向，并报告传感器之间的任何差异或不一致。"
